    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are given control over a spaceship, equipped with a Dark Drive. To make the things that happen in dark space comprehensible for the human mind, scientist have managed to simply the control. They designed an interface that will let you interpret flying through dark space, like it is just a colorful vertical scrolling shoot'em up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399840/extras/0a46979a72ab6e94f37441c43f57a4c4.poster.avif?t=1743540026\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399840/extras/0a46979a72ab6e94f37441c43f57a4c4.webm?t=1743540026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399840/extras/0a46979a72ab6e94f37441c43f57a4c4.mp4?t=1743540026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > will encounter dozens of different enemies, all with their own behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >have to fight a boss at every the end of every second level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >choose upgrades to help you survive each level</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are given control over a spaceship, equipped with a Dark Drive. To make the things that happen in dark space comprehensible for the human mind, scientist have managed to simply the control. They designed an interface that will let you interpret flying through dark space, like it is just a colorful vertical scrolling shoot'em up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399840/extras/0a46979a72ab6e94f37441c43f57a4c4.poster.avif?t=1743540026\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399840/extras/0a46979a72ab6e94f37441c43f57a4c4.webm?t=1743540026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399840/extras/0a46979a72ab6e94f37441c43f57a4c4.mp4?t=1743540026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > will encounter dozens of different enemies, all with their own behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >have to fight a boss at every the end of every second level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >choose upgrades to help you survive each level</p></li></ul>",
